  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><h1 data-lake-id=\"n9GMn\" id=\"n9GMn\"><span data-lake-id=\"u87b3ae8d\" id=\"u87b3ae8d\">案例设计</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u2ca2f12d\" id=\"u2ca2f12d\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689637924364-9de2639e-154e-4fd9-ab0c-5c013f83682c.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u75ce4129-4e52-4777-9644-3606651e43a%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1ab5feeb-9948-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A178.66666666666666%2C%22height%22%3A66%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid4.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A13908%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A402%2C%22originHeight%22%3A149%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%B0%8F%E4%B9%8C%E9%BE%9F%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%99%A8%22%2C%22x%22%3A71%2C%22y%22%3A7%2C%22width%22%3A92%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%225.54444%22%2C%22x%22%3A56%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A59%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%2210.54444%22%2C%22x%22%3A55%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A68%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22Y%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A8%2C%22y%22%3A78%2C%22width%22%3A44%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22X%E5%9D%90%E6%A0%87%22%2C%22x%22%3A10%2C%22y%22%3A45%2C%22width%22%3A42%2C%22height%22%3A15%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A184%2C%22y%22%3A113%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A16%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E5%9B%BD%E6%B1%9F%E7%89%8C%22%2C%22x%22%3A355%2C%22y%22%3A131%2C%22width%22%3A33%2C%22height%22%3A6%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23d6d2cf%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u792ae74c%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u81d03816\" id=\"u81d03816\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua6f87681\" id=\"ua6f87681\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">通过指定目标点的X和Y值，让小乌龟到达指定点。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"iMGv4\" id=\"iMGv4\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua60e281c\" id=\"ua60e281c\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">运动分析</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"uc5e89655\" id=\"uc5e89655\"><span data-lake-id=\"u815cfaac\" id=\"u815cfaac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">小乌龟如何到达目标点?</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"zSDgQ\" id=\"zSDgQ\"><span data-lake-id=\"u42bfb5f3\" id=\"u42bfb5f3\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">数据获取</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u8b7d7720\" id=\"u8b7d7720\"><span data-lake-id=\"u493ea376\" id=\"u493ea376\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">小乌龟当前的坐标和角度</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u14bae394\" id=\"u14bae394\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8f12323d\" id=\"u8f12323d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">可以通过订阅</span><span data-lake-id=\"ue488204e\" id=\"ue488204e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 71, 79)\">/turtle1/pose</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua3c53f51\" id=\"ua3c53f51\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">获得相关的信息</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"TGP8b\" id=\"TGP8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64871eff\" id=\"u64871eff\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">控制操作</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u050a646e\" id=\"u050a646e\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub74a0681\" id=\"ub74a0681\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">通过设置小乌龟的线速度和角速度可以让小乌龟动起来</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u08521f94\" id=\"u08521f94\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubd7b967d\" id=\"ubd7b967d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">可以通过发布数据到</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0131d2fb\" id=\"u0131d2fb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(55, 71, 79)\">/turtle1/cmd_vel</span><span data-lake-id=\"u0e3f1a3d\" id=\"u0e3f1a3d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">控制小乌龟移动</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"NRmEV\" id=\"NRmEV\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud05f0c08\" id=\"ud05f0c08\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">示例代码</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ub66f400b\" id=\"ub66f400b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6eb86838\" id=\"u6eb86838\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">发布者与订阅者</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20%E8%AE%A2%E9%98%85%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cnself.sub%20%3D%20self.node.create_subscription(Pose%2C'%2Fturtle1%2Fpose'%2Cself.pose_callback%2C10)%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%8F%E4%B9%8C%E9%BE%9F%E6%8E%A7%E5%88%B6%E5%8F%91%E5%B8%83%E8%80%85%5Cnself.control_pub%20%3D%20self.node.create_publisher(Twist%2C'%2Fturtle1%2Fcmd_vel'%2C10)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cmE7Q%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u2358b64b\" id=\"u2358b64b\"><span data-lake-id=\"udcd04b71\" id=\"udcd04b71\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">获取小乌龟实时位置信息的回调</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20pose_callback(self%2Cpose)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.curX%20%3D%20pose.x%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.curY%20%3D%20pose.y%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.curTheta%20%3D%20pose.theta%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E5%BD%93%E5%89%8D%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.xL.setText(str(self.curX))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.yL.setText(str(self.curY))%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20self.thetaL.setText(str(self.curTheta))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Dm6rw%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"zoUgg\" id=\"zoUgg\"><span data-lake-id=\"u719958ab\" id=\"u719958ab\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">直线运动计算</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"u95550543\" id=\"u95550543\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2023%2Fpng%2F27903758%2F1689638227327-b8b8529f-1287-4160-afe7-9dfb65f3f922.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u0fc363d6-80ab-4947-a777-f9445dc0926%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u1ab5feeb-9948-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A336%2C%22height%22%3A260%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22pid3.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A21293%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A756%2C%22originHeight%22%3A586%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.25%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22%E9%BB%91%E9%A9%AC%E7%A8%8B%E5%BA%8F%E5%91%98%22%2C%22x%22%3A599%2C%22y%22%3A547%2C%22width%22%3A149%2C%22height%22%3A30%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%2372b831%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u5f19543f%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufedb8bf6\" id=\"ufedb8bf6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud0255ac8\" id=\"ud0255ac8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">通过最简单的示例，先解决指线运动。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB%20%3D%20%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%20*%20%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%5Cn%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%20%3D%20%E8%B7%9D%E7%A6%BB%20%2F%20%E6%97%B6%E9%97%B4%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22zMX7w%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uaed9d0f6\" id=\"uaed9d0f6\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf94c11c6\" id=\"uf94c11c6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们已知的是当前小乌龟的坐标turtle(x, y) ，和目标点dist(x, y)，我们要去得到是小乌龟的速度。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0dd46b76\" id=\"u0dd46b76\"><span data-lake-id=\"u918cd996\" id=\"u918cd996\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">首先我们需要计算出两点间的距离：</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22def%20distance(self%2CcurX%2CcurY%2CtargetX%2CtargetY)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20math.sqrt(pow(targetX-curX%2C2)%2Bpow(targetY-curY%2C2))%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Qq4x0%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0cdb675c\" id=\"u0cdb675c\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3962591\" id=\"ub3962591\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">其次我们需要确定的是时间time，我们可以给定一个预期的值。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u77588e08\" id=\"u77588e08\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1ef4a1a0\" id=\"u1ef4a1a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们可以将计算的结果进行运行测试。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8b24be14\" id=\"u8b24be14\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e53ff55\" id=\"u7e53ff55\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">测试发现，小乌龟默认运行的时间是1s。没有提供给我们设置时间接口。</span></p><h1 data-lake-id=\"a3weY\" id=\"a3weY\"><span data-lake-id=\"u448a9bba\" id=\"u448a9bba\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">解决时间不可控的问题</span></h1><p data-lake-id=\"ue57e5029\" id=\"ue57e5029\"><span data-lake-id=\"u40b3058a\" id=\"u40b3058a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">方式一:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22rate%20%3D%20self.node.create_rate(1)%5Cnfor%20i%20in%20range(5)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20data%20%3D%20Twist()%5Cn%20%20%20%20data.linear.x%20%3D%20linearVel%5Cn%20%20%20%20data.angular.z%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20publisher.publish(twist)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22cU78P%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u211601d5\" id=\"u211601d5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u86d6b4ae\" id=\"u86d6b4ae\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">方式二:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22runDistance%20%3D%200%5Cnwhile%20runDistance%3Cdistance%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20data%20%3D%20Twist()%5Cn%20%20%20%20data.linear.x%20%3D%20linearVel%5Cn%20%20%20%20data.angular.z%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20publisher.publish(twist)%5Cn%20%20%20%20runDistance%20%2B%3D%20linearVel%20%2F%20hz%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Zjouq%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"uec164e3d\" id=\"uec164e3d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u724b0235\" id=\"u724b0235\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\">方式三:</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22while%20calcDistance(srcX%2C%20srcY%2C%20distX%2C%20distY)%20%3E%200.1%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%20%E8%8E%B7%E5%8F%96srcX%EF%BC%8CsrcY%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20srcX%20%3D%20pose-%3Ex%3B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20srcY%20%3D%20pose-%3Ey%3B%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%2F%2F%E8%AE%BE%E7%BD%AE%E9%80%9F%E5%BA%A6%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20data%20%3D%20Twist()%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20data.linear.x%20%3D%20linearVel%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20data.angular.z%20%3D%200%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20publisher.publish(twist)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20rate.sleep()%3B%5Cn%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22G2SX7%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><h1 data-lake-id=\"IOXyo\" id=\"IOXyo\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc0e33437\" id=\"uc0e33437\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">思考：是否存在完美的事物</span></h1><ul list=\"ubb8eb16d\"><li fid=\"u38ca2a08\" data-lake-id=\"ufa49a1f5\" id=\"ufa49a1f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub6a4a16f\" id=\"ub6a4a16f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">速度是否是绝对平均</span></li><li fid=\"u38ca2a08\" data-lake-id=\"u27407be7\" id=\"u27407be7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf2f1e45e\" id=\"uf2f1e45e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">距离差值是否是绝对为0</span></li><li fid=\"u38ca2a08\" data-lake-id=\"u4cc31a43\" id=\"u4cc31a43\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae8a5561\" id=\"uae8a5561\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">时间是否绝对为预期</span></li></ul>",
